# The unemupc commit whose CLI, upcli, imports and pushes the media sets and
# the firmware packages (lib/publish.py; see README.md). Build it there with
# `cargo build -p cli --bin upcli`. The digest pins in the manifests, of
# every set (media.toml) and every package (firmware.toml), are what this CLI
# gives; moving the pin is checked by those pins.
